            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/acce0b1fec0e2d69351d4dbbdf81cd75.avif?t=1782850960\" width=600 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An oldschool roguelike action platformer, tower defense game, and light RPG in one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated XO-Planets, unlock abilities like double jump, dash, and wall climbing, and fight to survive with one-handed weapons, turrets, missile launchers, and tesla towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is permanent, and most of your progress is lost when you die. But rare Xolyriums can be used to upgrade your Reconnoiter between runs, giving you a fighting chance on your next expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience, skill, and smart preparation are required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to annihilate the abominations of XO-Planets and find a new home for mankind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/c247fa300b4e08cc9256f429af7a5104.webp?t=1782850960\" width=399 height=49 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels where no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated weapons across 9 weapon types: sword, axe, whip, gun, shotgun, sniper, and 3 launcher types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon enhancements including vampiric, fire, and ice effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your weapons with powerful mod drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down and collect Legendary weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 AI Unit enhancement mods, including Jet-Pack, Teleport, and Juggernaut.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades using rare Xolyriums.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Distro Machine to buy enhancements for your AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart and eliminate 5 major bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down and kill 5 bounty mini-bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate 25 enemy creatures with unique behaviors and immunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend in local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the Jukebox and listen to the soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/97bc633e66c29b95f6e59b845f939255.webp?t=1782850960\" width=399 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a variety of randomized mission types during each run:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and Destroy</strong>: Hunt down and eliminate key enemy targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounty Hunter</strong>: Track and kill dangerous mini-bosses for rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomber Man</strong>: Plant explosives and destroy critical enemy structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunter</strong>: Search the planet for valuable loot and rare resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Defense</strong>: Build defenses and survive waves of attacking abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruins of War</strong>: Explore ruined battlefields filled with danger, loot, and hidden threats. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/b8d896739804b36e4e31e2e083802642.webp?t=1782850960\" width=399 height=49 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock each member of the G-Raiders crew and discover their stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect intel on every invader you encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 6 AI Reconnoiters, each with a different playstyle to unlock and master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/ece5c9dd562db55fedecaa7669ab2304.avif?t=1782850960\" width=500 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/86efef617b717e411c6d1e4039918261.webp?t=1782850960\" width=399 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/70e3352d38ae9fd2b619a0f4dd931917.avif?t=1782850960\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/acce0b1fec0e2d69351d4dbbdf81cd75.avif?t=1782850960\" width=600 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An oldschool roguelike action platformer, tower defense game, and light RPG in one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated XO-Planets, unlock abilities like double jump, dash, and wall climbing, and fight to survive with one-handed weapons, turrets, missile launchers, and tesla towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is permanent, and most of your progress is lost when you die. But rare Xolyriums can be used to upgrade your Reconnoiter between runs, giving you a fighting chance on your next expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patience, skill, and smart preparation are required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to annihilate the abominations of XO-Planets and find a new home for mankind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/c247fa300b4e08cc9256f429af7a5104.webp?t=1782850960\" width=399 height=49 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels where no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated weapons across 9 weapon types: sword, axe, whip, gun, shotgun, sniper, and 3 launcher types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon enhancements including vampiric, fire, and ice effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your weapons with powerful mod drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down and collect Legendary weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 AI Unit enhancement mods, including Jet-Pack, Teleport, and Juggernaut.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades using rare Xolyriums.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Distro Machine to buy enhancements for your AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart and eliminate 5 major bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down and kill 5 bounty mini-bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate 25 enemy creatures with unique behaviors and immunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend in local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the Jukebox and listen to the soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/97bc633e66c29b95f6e59b845f939255.webp?t=1782850960\" width=399 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a variety of randomized mission types during each run:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and Destroy</strong>: Hunt down and eliminate key enemy targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounty Hunter</strong>: Track and kill dangerous mini-bosses for rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomber Man</strong>: Plant explosives and destroy critical enemy structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunter</strong>: Search the planet for valuable loot and rare resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Defense</strong>: Build defenses and survive waves of attacking abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruins of War</strong>: Explore ruined battlefields filled with danger, loot, and hidden threats. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/b8d896739804b36e4e31e2e083802642.webp?t=1782850960\" width=399 height=49 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock each member of the G-Raiders crew and discover their stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect intel on every invader you encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 6 AI Reconnoiters, each with a different playstyle to unlock and master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/ece5c9dd562db55fedecaa7669ab2304.avif?t=1782850960\" width=500 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/86efef617b717e411c6d1e4039918261.webp?t=1782850960\" width=399 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439730/extras/70e3352d38ae9fd2b619a0f4dd931917.avif?t=1782850960\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
